    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d817">

                <pb facs="1033" n="937" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg937"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Day to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date
                            ana="#date_imprecise-inferred-from-document-content"
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1898-10-27T16:30:00+00:09"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">October 27, 1898</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 18.]</seg></opener>
                <p>At meeting to-day Spaniards accepted our last draft articles 1 and 2 as to Cuba,
                    Puerto Rico, and Guam in exact language of protocol, expressly subject to
                    agreement being reached on all the articles which treaty should contain. Then
                    asked when we should be ready to proceed to question of Philippine Islands, and
                    on our motion adjournment had till Monday for that purpose. Tuesday and
                    Wednesday following being religious holidays, understood if not ready Monday can
                    have what further time desired.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-10-27T16:30:00+00:09">Thursday, 4.30,
                        afternoon</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Day.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
